    card title "Count to ten"

A: How do you count to ten in Russian?
    draw d1 d2 d3 d4 d5 d6 d7 d8 d9 d10 parallel true

B: Оди́н, два, три.
    draw w1 w2 w3 parallel true

A: Оди́н is one, and два and три are old relatives of duo and trio.
    highlight w2 w3 effect underline color #8f887c

B: Четы́ре, пять, шесть.
    draw w4 w5 w6 parallel true

A: Пять is a cousin of penta, five; and шесть, six, starts with Ш, the sh you heard in хорошо́.
    blocking false

    highlight w5 effect underline color #8f887c duration 2.6

    highlight w6 part ^ш color #d0865f duration 3.5

B: Семь, во́семь, де́вять, де́сять.
    draw w7 w8 w9 w10 parallel true

A: Семь, seven, hides inside во́семь, eight; and nine and ten differ by one letter: в in де́вять, с in де́сять.
    blocking false

    highlight w8 part семь$ color #d0865f duration 3.4

    highlight w9 part в color #d0865f duration 2.4

    highlight w10 part с color #d0865f duration 2.6

A: Now look at the ends: one to four have nothing special, but five to ten all end in the same letter.
    blocking false

    highlight w1 w2 w3 w4 effect underline color #8f887c duration 2.8

    highlight w5 w6 w7 w8 w9 w10 part ь$ color #4f8a4a effect pulse duration 3.2

B: It's the soft sign: it makes no sound of its own, it only softens the letter before it.
    highlight w5 w6 w7 w8 w9 w10 part ь$ color #f2c14e

    hide digits

    ask "Which one is eight? Tap it." choose ["w4","w5","w6","w7","w8","w9","w10"] answer w8
        intro: The digits are gone: can you still read the words?
        right: Во́семь, eight: the one with семь inside.
        wrong: Look for seven hiding inside a longer word.

    show digits

    hide board

A: Ten numbers are enough for a phone numbe (@draw phone pnum@)r, and Masha reads hers out one digit at a time.

B: Пять, три, де́вять, два, семь, во́семь, шесть.
    draw pw1 pw2 pw3 pw4 pw5 pw6 pw7

B: Russians often say a number in bigger chunks, like five hundred and thirty-nine, but digit by digit, everyone understands you.
    highlight pnum part "539" effect underline color #8f887c

    erase phonerow phone

    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name parallel true

A: Numbers also find you a seat: back in Masha's café, she shows me to my table.
    draw sign plate

    dialogue cafe speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Здра́вствуйте! Стол но́мер семь.","gloss":"Hello! Table number seven."},{"by":"a","text":"Но́мер семь? Спаси́бо!","gloss":"Number seven? Thank you!"},{"by":"b","text":"Пожа́луйста!","gloss":"You're welcome!"}] size 1.4

    draw cafe

    draw cafe

A: Стол is the table from lesson two, and но́мер means number; I said the number back to check I'd heard it right.
    highlight cafe_2

    erase cafe

    erase table

    hide speakers

    show board

A: So ten short words, several with cousins in English, and a letter you see in six of them but never hear.
    blocking false

    highlight w2 w3 w5 w8 effect underline color #8f887c duration 3

    highlight w5 w6 w7 w8 w9 w10 part ь$ color #4f8a4a duration 3.4

    hide board

    cards match size 1.8 y 460
        * "четы́ре" match "4"
        * "шесть" match "6"
        * "во́семь" match "8"
        * "де́сять" match "10"

    ask "Match each Russian number to its digit." on match store m stage own test t1
        intro: Five questions now, from memory, then your score.
        right: Четы́ре, four; шесть, six; во́семь, eight; and де́сять, ten.
        wrong: You got {m} on the first try.

    erase match

    text q3 "3" #3d3833 x 500 y 470 font_size 160

    ask "Type three in Russian." answer ["три"] translit true store a3 default три reveal.text три reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 80 reveal.color #2f6b8f test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЧШЫЬЯ
        right: Три: three, like trio.
        wrong: Think of trio: three letters.

    erase q3 a3_stamp

    text q8 "во́семь" #2f6b8f say true colors {"ь$":"#4f8a4a"} x 500 y 560 font_size 110

    ask "What number is во́семь? Type it in digits." answer ["8"] store a8 default "8" reveal.text "8" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 90 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        right: Во́семь is eight: семь, seven, hides inside it.
        wrong: Find the smaller number hiding inside it, then add one.

    erase q8 a8_stamp

    icon qphone size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 500 or ["telephone"] icon_look picture of "mobile phone"

    ask "My number starts пять, три, де́вять. Type those three digits." answer ["539","5 3 9","5-3-9"] store aph default "539" reveal.text "539" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 90 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        right: Пять, три, де́вять: five, three, nine, the start of my number.
        wrong: One word, one digit: start with пять, five.

    erase qphone aph_stamp

    text q10 "10" #3d3833 x 500 y 470 font_size 160

    quiz "Which one is 10?" reveal.text де́сять reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 80 reveal.color #2f6b8f test t1
        right: Де́сять: ten has с in the middle; де́вять, with в, is nine.
        wrong: Nine and ten differ by one letter in the middle.
        * де́вять
        + де́сять
        * во́семь

    erase q10 reveal_4_stamp

    show board

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

B: Now you can count all the way to де́сять. Next time: how to say you speak Russian. Пока́!
    highlight w10 effect underline color #8f887c

